The transverse momentum, centrality, and pseudorapidity dependence of the BEMC matching efficiency in Au+Au can be found in Appendix C.2, and no significant centrality or pseudorapidity dependence was observed. The BEMC matching efficiency obtained from simulation has been used to correct the final results as a function of transverse momentum.

